RED FLAG 9 — ANNEXURE LIST: REMOVE "PAGES", FIX MATERIAL NAME (ALL 4)
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Bug: List of Annexures generates unreliable "Pages" (p.2, pp.3-4); material name
defaults to product/API name (Chlorpromazine RS listed DSM Ascorbic COA, Merck
