- No "–" in a quantitative cell that had a number.
- EI Figure 1: empty placeholder or bare caption — NEVER a black box.

RED FLAG 12 — DRUG PRODUCT MASS FOR INJECTION (RS + EI)
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Injection drug-product mass = daily_volume_mL × density_g_per_mL × 1000.
Chlorpromazine showed 129600 mg; expected ~96000 (96 mL × 1.0). Verify; density
optional/auto-estimate. Affects equivalent-ppm total only, not pass/fail.

