GLOBAL NON-NEGOTIABLES
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
- EI: ND/"<X"/"<30% Perm Conc" → 0 (except presence-flagged bound). RS: BDL/BLQ
  with NMT spec → NMT worst-case (never 0). NEVER conflate the two.
- Salt/base: BASE for volume, SALT for amounts. Strength = MDD÷doses only for
  solid OSD; injections derive volume = MDD÷conc.
- Never force max strength; never sum multiple strength columns.
- No fabricated values; empty → "Not provided."; no black box; no "–"; no
  ellipsis; no Pages column; DMSO/spelling variants merged.
- No table exceeds page width (landscape for matrices).
- Warning-first; hard-block only: no files / all extractions failed / zero rows.
- Preserve verified maths (EI per-element formula, RS Trilaciclib/Epinephrine/
  Chlorpromazine amounts, RS NMT worst-case). No Streamlit in backend.


